{
  "id": "section-ghosts-table",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0000",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Ghosts table (d6)\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[68,22,40]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0001",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "1\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[68,40,42]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0002",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "The Bright Apparition. L3 Ghost. Save vs. L3 light or be partially blinded\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[68,42,117]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0003",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "until the end of your next encounter ( -1 on all  Attack, Defense and magic\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[68,117,193]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0004",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "rolls. Will rolls and saves are unaffected). The ghost disappears after 1 turn,\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[68,193,273]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0005",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "but you have a chance to exorcise it, and gain 1 XP or 1 Clue from its words\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[68,273,350]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0006",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "(your choice) if you successfully do so.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[68,350,391]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0007",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "2\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[68,391,393]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0008",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Cold Air spirit. L4 Ghost, 4 Life, damage 1. The ghost will blow freezing\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[68,393,467]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0009",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "cold air at you. You must save versus L4 cold (save at +1 if you are wearing\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[68,467,544]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0010",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "winter clothes) or lose 1 Life and have a -1 on all Attack rolls for the duration\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[68,544,626]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0011",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "of the encounter. Susceptible to exorcism.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[68,626,669]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0012",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "3\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[68,669,671]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0013",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "The Whispering Presence. L5 Ghost. Pass a L5 Will roll  (add +1 if you have\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[68,671,747]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0014",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Will or +2 if you have it at Expert level) or the ghost’s whispers will lead you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[68,747,828]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0015",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "astray (move to a box that you already visited, rolling a 2 in 6 chance of a\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[68,828,905]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0016",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "random encounter; if you cannot move to any boxes that you already\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[68,905,972]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0017",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "visited, just move to a random neighboring box and roll for a random\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[68,972,1041]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0018",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "encounter AFTER resolving the encounter in that box). If you pass the Will\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[68,1041,1116]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0019",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "roll, you may perform a L5 Charisma roll to ask him a question (if successful,\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[68,1116,1195]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0020",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "you gain 1 Clue).\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[68,1195,1213]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0021",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "4\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[68,1213,1215]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0022",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "The Face in the Mist. L4 Ghost. A thick fog surrounds you, and a grotesque\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[68,1215,1290]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0023",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "face appears multiple times, trying to scare you. Roll three L4 saves. Add\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[68,1290,1365]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0024",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "+1 if you have Will or +2 if you have it at Expert level. Lose 1 Sanity with\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[68,1365,1442]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0025",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "each failure.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[68,1442,1456]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0026",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "5\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[68,1456,1458]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0027",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "The Tickling Ghost. L4 Ghost. It tickles you with its cold ectoplasm fingers.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[68,1458,1536]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0028",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "On every failed Defense roll, you take no damage but you lose 1 carried\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[68,1536,1608]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0029",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "item. If you carry no items, the ghost will freeze your blood, inflicting 1\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[68,1608,1684]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0030",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Damage with every touch. You may attack it only with magic weapons.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[68,1684,1752]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0031",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Susceptible to exorcism.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[68,1752,1777]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0032",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "6\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[68,1777,1779]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0033",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "The Ghost Librarian. L6 Ghost. You may try to exorcize him, or ask him a\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[68,1779,1852]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0034",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "question with a successful L4 Charisma roll (gain 1 Clue on a success). You\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[68,1852,1928]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0035",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "may continue asking questions until you have gained 3 Clues or you fail. If\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[68,1928,2004]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0036",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "you fail, the Librarian will take away one of your books, if you have any\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[68,2004,2078]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0037",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "(choose one and delete it from your inventory). If you do not have any\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[68,2078,2149]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0038",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "books, the next book you find in the campaign will vanish before you have\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[68,2149,2223]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0039",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "any chance to read it.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[68,2223,2246]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0040",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "All ghosts without Life points may not be hit by Attack rolls. All ghosts with Life\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[68,2246,2330]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0041",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "points take a maximum of 1 Life damage by any attack not performed with a\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[68,2330,2404]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0042",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "magic weapon. Ghosts are Undead but they are NOT susceptible to holy water.",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[68,2404,2479]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0043",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "aliens table (d6) 1 xp\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[69,22,45]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0044",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "1\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[69,45,47]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0045",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "d6 Grays.  L4 aliens, 1 Life, damage 1. Armed with alien\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[69,47,104]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0046",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "rayguns. In your hands, they have +1 to Attack rolls, damage\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[69,104,165]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0047",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "1,  damage 2 vs. shadow creatures; on any Attack roll of 1\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[69,165,224]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0048",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "the gun stops working and there is nothing you can do to\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[69,224,281]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0049",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "repair it. Loot: 1 raygun per alien.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[69,281,318]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0050",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "2\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[69,318,320]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0051",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Alien Hunter. L6 alien, 8 Life, damage 2, 4 in 6 chance of\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[69,320,379]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0052",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "surprise. If you are not surprised, you may avoid this\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[69,379,434]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0053",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "encounter with a L6 Stealth roll. Escape rolls against the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[69,434,493]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0054",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Hunter are at -1. Loot: 1 grenade.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[69,493,528]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0055",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "3\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[69,528,530]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0056",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Alien beast. L6 alien, 6 Life, damage 2, 3 in 6 chance of\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[69,530,588]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0057",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "surprise. Every time you wound the alien, there is a 2 in 6\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[69,588,648]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0058",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "chance that a splash from its acid blood will hit you, inflicting\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[69,648,714]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0059",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "1 damage if you fail a Defense roll.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[69,714,751]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0060",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "4\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[69,751,753]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0061",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "d6 Reptilians. L4 aliens, 2 Life each, damage 1. Each blow\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[69,753,812]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0062",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "that hits a reptilian has a 1 in 6 chance of bouncing off its\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[69,812,874]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0063",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "scaly skin. Loot: 1 sword per alien.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[69,874,911]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0064",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "5\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[69,911,913]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0065",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "d3 Mi-Go. L5 alien fungi, 1 Life each, damage 2. Upon seeing\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[69,913,974]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0066",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "these creatures, Save vs. L5 Fear or lose 1 Sanity. Each blow\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[69,974,1036]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0067",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "that hits a mi-go has a 2 in 6 chance of having no effect. Loot:\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[69,1036,1101]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0068",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "1 mysterious black stone covered in hieroglyphs. If you pick\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[69,1101,1162]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0069",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "it up, read unique event #30.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[69,1162,1192]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0070",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "6\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[69,1192,1194]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0071",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Tentacled Beast. L4 alien, 4 Life, damage 1. The beast\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[69,1194,1249]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0072",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "attacks each turn with 4 tentacles. You must defend\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[69,1249,1301]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0073",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "separately from each tentacle. As long as the beast has 3 or\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[69,1301,1362]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0074",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "4 tentacles, you may not Escape from this encounter. For\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[69,1362,1419]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0075",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "each point of damage inflicted on the beast, it loses 1 tentacle.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[69,1419,1485]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0076",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Various alien civilizations have been studying Earth since ancient times.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[69,1485,1559]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0077",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Some use alien beasts as watchdogs. Aliens are very interested in\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[69,1559,1625]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0078",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "understanding the reasons for the supernatural disaster that has opened\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[69,1625,1697]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0079",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "up the Gates of Hell.",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[69,1697,1718]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0080",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Unique Vampires table (d6) 1 XP\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[70,22,54]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0081",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "1\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[70,54,56]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0082",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Upyr. L5 Undead, vampire, 8 Life, damage 1. When you encounter the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[70,56,123]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0083",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Upyr, d6 Food points that you carry will rot. If more Food will rot than\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[70,123,196]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0084",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "you carry, Save vs. L5 disease (add +1 if you have the Resilient Skill, +2 if\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[70,196,274]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0085",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "at expert level). If you fail, you must save again on every box until you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[70,274,348]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0086",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "reach a Safe House, where the disease stops. Vulnerable to holy symbols.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[70,348,421]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0087",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Loot: 1 random item.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[70,421,442]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0088",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "2\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[70,442,444]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0089",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Wurdalak. L5 Undead, vampire, 8 Life, damage 1. There is a 3 in 6 chance\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[70,444,517]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0090",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "that this shapeshifting vampire will be in wolf form when encountered.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[70,517,588]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0091",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "In wolf form, its damage is 2 and you have -1 on any Escape roll.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[70,588,654]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0092",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Vulnerable to holy symbols.  Loot: 1 random item.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[70,654,704]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0093",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "3\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[70,704,706]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0094",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Kempir. L6 Undead, vampire, 6 Life, damage 1. Every time she attacks,\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[70,706,776]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0095",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "roll a 4 in 6 chance that she tries to suck blood from your knees. In this\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[70,776,851]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0096",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "case, you defend at +2 but if you are hit, you automatically receive the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[70,851,924]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0097",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Limping injury until you heal ALL damage (see the Injury table).\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[70,924,989]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0098",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Vulnerable to holy symbols. Loot: 1 rope.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[70,989,1031]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0099",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "4\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[70,1031,1033]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0100",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Vehn. L6 Undead, vampire, 5 Life, damage 1. If you roll a 1 on any Defense\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[70,1033,1108]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0101",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "roll, the Vehn tears away one large slice of your skin, giving you a -1 on\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[70,1108,1183]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0102",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Charisma rolls. The modifier remains until you heal all damage. The Vehn\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[70,1183,1256]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0103",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "takes 3 damage (not 2) from holy water.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[70,1256,1296]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0104",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "5\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[70,1296,1298]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0105",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Vetala. L4 Undead, vampire, 6 Life, damage 1. The Vetala can foretell the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[70,1298,1372]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0106",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "future: if you offer 6 Food (or 2 Life points in your blood) and pass a L5\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[70,1372,1447]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0107",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Charisma roll, you may use the equivalent of one use of the Foretell\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[70,1447,1516]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0108",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Arcane Skill and the Vetala will let you move through her area. If you fail\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[70,1516,1592]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0109",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "or do not attempt this, you must fight. The Vetala recovers 1 Life every\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[70,1592,1665]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0110",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "time she damages you, up to her maximum Life. Loot: 2 random items.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[70,1665,1733]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0111",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "6\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[70,1733,1735]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0112",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "The Midnight Man. L6 Undead, vampire, 8 Life, damage 2. 4 in 6 chance\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[70,1735,1805]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0113",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "of surprise. If this dark-clad predator surprises you, he grabs your arms.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[70,1805,1880]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0114",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "You may not attack until you perform a L6 Strength roll. Roll at +1 if you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[70,1880,1955]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0115",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "have the Strong Skill, +2 if you have Strong (Expert). Until you are held,\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[70,1955,2030]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0116",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "you take automatic damage every turn.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[70,2030,2068]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0117",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "These encounters will happen only once per game. Reroll if you encounter again\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[70,2068,2147]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0118",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "a vampire that you destroyed.  Vampires are vulnerable to holy water, taking\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[70,2147,2224]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0119",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "2 damage from a vial. In addition, they all use rules for a vampire returning\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[70,2224,2302]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0120",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "from the dead (see vampire in the Undead table, p.60).",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[70,2302,2356]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0121",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Unique Zombies table (d6) 1 XP\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[71,22,53]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0122",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "1\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[71,53,55]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0123",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Zombie Tiger. L5 Undead, 6 Life, Damage 2. If you roll a 1 on a\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[71,55,119]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0124",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Defense roll, the zombie tiger savages your body and you MUST\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[71,119,181]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0125",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "roll on the Injury table. If you already have 3 Injuries, lose 3 Life\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[71,181,251]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0126",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "instead.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[71,251,260]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0127",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "2\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[71,260,262]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0128",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Horde of Zombie Squirrels. L4 Undead, 8 Life, Damage 1. The\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[71,262,322]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0129",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "whole horde is treated as a single creature. Every turn, roll a 2 in\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[71,322,391]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0130",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "6 chance of losing one carried item of your choice or 2 Food points\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[71,391,459]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0131",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "(choose) until the horde is defeated.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[71,459,497]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0132",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "3\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[71,497,499]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0133",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Your Zombie Pet. L3 Undead, 3 Life, Damage 1. Every turn, you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[71,499,561]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0134",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "must pass a L3 Will roll (add bonuses from the Will Skill) or you will\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[71,561,632]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0135",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "be unable to attack your pet that has returned from the Pet\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[71,632,692]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0136",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Cemetery.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[71,692,702]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0137",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "4\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[71,702,704]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0138",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Your Zombie Friend. L5 Undead, 4 Life, Damage 1, Slow. Every\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[71,704,765]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0139",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "turn, you must pass a L3 Will roll. Add +1 if you have the Will Skill,\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[71,765,836]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0140",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "and +2 if you have Will (Expert). If you fail, you will be unable to\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[71,836,905]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0141",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "attack your recently deceased friend (spouse, relative, etc: you can\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[71,905,974]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0142",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "embellish as desired) who returned from the grave to eat you.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[71,974,1036]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0143",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "5\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[71,1036,1038]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0144",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "d6 Brain Eaters. L5 Undead, 1 Life, Damage 1. If you roll a 1 on a\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[71,1038,1105]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0145",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Defense roll when you are in combat with 3 or more brain eaters,\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[71,1105,1170]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0146",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "you will be grabbed and will be unable to Escape until you reduce\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[71,1170,1236]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0147",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "their number to 2 or below.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[71,1236,1264]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0148",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "6\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[71,1264,1266]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0149",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Zombie Abominion. L7 Undead, 12 Life, Damage 2, Slow. If you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[71,1266,1327]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0150",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Escape, the abominion will pursue you. Roll a 2 in 6 chance of\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[71,1327,1390]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0151",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "encountering it again with ALL wounds healed in the next three\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[71,1390,1453]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0152",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "boxes you cross. If you have an encounter in that box, you will\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[71,1453,1517]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0153",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "have to resolve that encounter first and then meet the zombie\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[71,1517,1579]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0154",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "abominion. If you manage to Escape three times in a row, the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[71,1579,1640]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0155",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Zombie Abominion will not pursue you anymore.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[71,1640,1686]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0156",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "These encounters will happen only once per game. If you roll an encounter\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[71,1686,1760]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-ghosts-table:p0157",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "that you already had, reroll until you select a different encounter.",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[71,1760,1828]]"
    }
  ],
  "sourcePages": [
    68,
